From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arvind Oruganti <aoruganti@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 19:57:52 +0530
Subject: Fix ICU 78 CodeQL format-string and memory-safety warnings

13 cpp/wrong-type-format-argument fixes (E1+E2) and 8 use-after-free /
double-free fixes (E4) across 6 test files, each mirroring an existing
in-tree idiom (austrdup for UChar* printed with %s; int32_t casts for
size_t/UDate; NULL-after-free for reused pointers). These are
long-standing upstream bugs not covered by #153. Recorded as an
icu-patches record so a future ICU upstream import does not revert them.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

